cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Griffith in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Griffith: Differentiable Logic Gate Networks for PyTorch"
abstract: >-
  Griffith is a PyTorch library for differentiable logic gate networks: it
  trains logic circuits with gradient descent and exports them to an
  intermediate representation, Verilog, and VHDL for hardware deployment.
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-20"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/tsukushi-gate/Griffith"
url: "https://tsukushi-gate.github.io/Griffith/"
keywords:
  - differentiable logic gate networks
  - logic gate network
  - lookup table network
  - pytorch
  - hardware acceleration
  - fpga
authors:
